Third-Party Open-Source Adaptations (MIT License):

- Developer cache categories & risk tier taxonomy adapted from bysiber/cleardisk
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) bysiber).
- Artifact discovery & recent-activity safety guard adapted from guhcostan/mac-cleaner-cli
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) Gustavo Costa).
- Protected deletion root validation adapted from tw93/Mole
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) Tw93).
- POSIX process table parsing adapted from sindresorhus/ps-list
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) Sindre Sorhus) and soyuka/pidusage
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) Antoine Bluchet).
- Two-phase biological NREM/REM sleep memory consolidation, clustering, belief
  conflict resolution, and associative linking adapted from Fozikio/cortex-engine
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) Fozikio).
- Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler (FSRS) retention and forgetting curve model
  powered by open-spaced-repetition/ts-fsrs (MIT License, Copyright (c) Open
  Spaced Repetition).
- Pure TypeScript BM25, prefix, and fuzzy full-text memory indexing powered by
  lucaong/minisearch (MIT License, Copyright (c) Luca Ongaro).
